<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span><span id="A5.F8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Effect of distortions.</span> MOLM generations from MS COCO under a variety of distortions applied during evaluation.
These include geometric transformations such as random cropping (<math id="A5.F8.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10\%</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.F8.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="50\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50\%</annotation></semantics></math>) and rotations (<math id="A5.F8.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25^{\circ}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>25</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25^{\circ}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A5.F8.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="90^{\circ}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">90^{\circ}</annotation></semantics></math>), resizing to different scales (<math id="A5.F8.m17" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="0.3\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.3\times</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A5.F8.m18" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="0.7\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.7</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.7\times</annotation></semantics></math>), photometric changes such as brightness adjustment (<math id="A5.F8.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times 1.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times 1.5</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A5.F8.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times 2.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times 2.0</annotation></semantics></math>), and lossy compression using JPEG (quality 80 and 50).</figcaption>
</figure>
