<td id="A5.F10.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.00293v1/figures/coco_ddim.png" id="A5.F10.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:121/121;" width="121" height="121" alt="Refer to caption"></td>
<td id="A5.F10.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.00293v1/figures/coco_dpms.png" id="A5.F10.g7" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:121/121;" width="121" height="121" alt="Refer to caption"></td>
<td id="A5.F10.2.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.00293v1/figures/coco_euler.png" id="A5.F10.g8" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:121/121;" width="121" height="121" alt="Refer to caption"></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span><span id="A5.F10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sampling configurations.</span> Qualitative examples from MS COCO showing MOLM generations under the sampling settings reported in Table <a href="#A4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ D.4 Sampling Configurations ‣ Appendix D Ablations ‣ MOLM: Mixture of LoRA Markers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>: CFG scale (top), number of steps (middle), and sampler type (bottom). Across all settings, watermarks remain consistently recoverable while maintaining fidelity.</figcaption>
</figure>
