<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span><span id="A5.F11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LoRA rank ablation.</span> Qualitative examples from MS COCO showing MOLM generations with different LoRA adapter ranks. Higher ranks preserve fidelity and watermark recovery more reliably,
while very low ranks (e.g., 8) introduce visible degradation.</figcaption>
</figure>
